      {
       "p": "Website: https://www.autoriteitpersoonsgegevens.nl/en"
      },
      {
       "p": "19.2. You may also have the right to complain to the data protection authority in the EU or EEA country where you live, work, or believe your rights have been infringed."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s20",
     "heading": "20. Changes to this Privacy Policy",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "p": "20.1. We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in the Platform, our services, our data practices, legal requirements, safety practices, or business operations."
