      {
       "p": "20.3. Where appropriate or legally required, we may also notify you through the Platform, by email, or by another appropriate method."
      },
      {
       "p": "20.4. Continued use of the Platform after changes become effective means that you acknowledge the updated Privacy Policy."
      }
     ]
    },
